I18N[amnezia_err_ipacket_b_first]="%s rejected: the packet starts with <%s>, and Keenetic routers (KeeneticOS 5.1) reject a key whose signature packet does not start with <b>. Start with <b 0x…> — e.g. <b 0x…><r 10>, not <r 10><b 0x…>."
I18N[amnezia_warn_ipacket_b_first]="%s starts with <%s> — Keenetic routers (KeeneticOS 5.1) will not accept a key with such an %s; other clients connect as before. To make keys fit Keenetic too (1.5 and 2.0 keys), replace %s via «Change a single parameter» on the profile card (in the panel — «Obfuscation parameters» → «Change a parameter»): start with <b 0x…>."
